  "description": "Influencer Ji-Han has been chasing his first love Do-Jin since high school, after Do-Jin suddenly vanished without a word. Now in college, a mysterious account that always likes his posts might be the clue that leads him back. In a world where love hides in likes and fate rewrites itself in DMs, can Ji-Han and Do-Jin finally hit \"post\" on their destiny ending?\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
